The package MaterialIcons-Rounded and the class MaterialThemeIconsArt of the
package MaterialIcons-ThemePack hold PNG renderings of those icons, at 10 to 64
pixels, made from the SVG files by scripts/generate.py (CairoSVG): they are
modified forms (rasterized) of the original files.  The upstream repository has
no NOTICE file.
